                <characteristic name="Declare" typeId="bad3-f9c5-ba46-18cb">Pick a friendly non-**^^Hero^^** non-**^^Fly Ossiarch Bonereapers Infantry^^** unit to be the target.</characteristic>
                <characteristic name="Effect" typeId="b6f1-ba36-6cd-3b03">Pick 1 of the following effects to apply until the start of your next turn.
• The target has ^^**Ward (5+)^^**.
• Add 1 to charge rolls for the target.
• Add 1 to wound rolls for the target&apos;s attacks.
• The target&apos;s melee weapons have **Anti-charge (+1 Rend)**.</characteristic>
